    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HEXA WORLD 3D \u2013 The Next Evolution in Hex Puzzle Games</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HEXA WORLD 3D</strong> is a 3D hexagonal puzzle game featuring procedurally generated levels, tactical boosters, XP-based progression, unlockable content, and global leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a cozy-yet-competitive puzzle experience where every move counts. Master the hex grid, trigger powerful combos, level up, collect rewards, and prove your skills across three distinct game modes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally Generated Levels</strong><br>Every level is dynamically created to match your progress and skill level, delivering a fresh challenge each time you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The generation system includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple field shapes: hexagon, diamond, triangle, chaotic, square</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Orientation: flat-top or pointy-top layouts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locked tiles and color stacks based on your level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goal scoring calculated from map layout and difficulty</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535110/extras/537ddeff0b2d50f8b4a65b08f2a0ebe4.poster.avif?t=1755021240\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535110/extras/537ddeff0b2d50f8b4a65b08f2a0ebe4.webm?t=1755021240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535110/extras/537ddeff0b2d50f8b4a65b08f2a0ebe4.mp4?t=1755021240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Modes:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Competitive Mode</strong> \u2013 You have 5 minutes to score as high as possible and rise through the monthly leaderboard.<br><strong>Infinity Mode</strong> \u2013 Play without time pressure. Customize your board and relax while chasing big combos.<br><strong>Level Mode</strong> \u2013 Beat endless waves of generated puzzles, earn XP, and collect boosters and loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535110/extras/ed89f8678f68706a03b518e7945940f8.poster.avif?t=1755021240\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535110/extras/ed89f8678f68706a03b518e7945940f8.webm?t=1755021240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535110/extras/ed89f8678f68706a03b518e7945940f8.mp4?t=1755021240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Progression and Unlockables:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn XP by completing matches and building combos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up to unlock new maps, skins, and tactical boosters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect additional cosmetics and rewards via a built-in loot system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Apply your unlocked content across all game modes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535110/extras/91819921b1187a2756da15c46f0776e9.poster.avif?t=1755021240\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535110/extras/91819921b1187a2756da15c46f0776e9.webm?t=1755021240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535110/extras/91819921b1187a2756da15c46f0776e9.mp4?t=1755021240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tactical Boosters:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hammer</strong> \u2013 Smash any tower and gain bonus points</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Swap</strong> \u2013 Refresh the available block stacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlocker</strong> \u2013 Remove all blocked cells</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Field Cleanser</strong> \u2013 Clear all tiles (except locked ones) without scoring</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use boosters strategically to overcome difficult boards and set new high scores.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535110/extras/6e1f23cfe5a48b2b01f84417fe1696d8.poster.avif?t=1755021240\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535110/extras/6e1f23cfe5a48b2b01f84417fe1696d8.webm?t=1755021240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535110/extras/6e1f23cfe5a48b2b01f84417fe1696d8.mp4?t=1755021240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play Your Way:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're chasing leaderboard glory, relaxing with endless puzzles, or unlocking everything the game has to offer, HEXA WORLD 3D supports all types of players:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual progression and daily rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Competitive score hunting with seasonal resets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creative sandboxing in Infinity Mode</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Global Leaderboards:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progress Leaderboard</strong> \u2013 Tracks your level and unlocks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monthly Competitive Leaderboard</strong> \u2013 Resets each month for new seasonal rankings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn a special in-game achievement for scoring over 10,000 points in one match</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535110/extras/739ab279a6a6aae3a91941ed9d6701fd.poster.avif?t=1755021240\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535110/extras/739ab279a6a6aae3a91941ed9d6701fd.webm?t=1755021240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535110/extras/739ab279a6a6aae3a91941ed9d6701fd.mp4?t=1755021240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlockable Maps and Visual Themes:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Office</strong> \u2013 a clean, modern puzzle layout</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Winter</strong> \u2013 snowy, atmospheric level design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Room</strong> \u2013 cozy and retro-styled environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Savannah</strong> - summer, atmospheric level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More locations coming soon: Space, Halloween, Desert</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535110/extras/36f7377052c8454b303a12954eafc505.poster.avif?t=1755021240\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535110/extras/36f7377052c8454b303a12954eafc505.webm?t=1755021240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535110/extras/36f7377052c8454b303a12954eafc505.mp4?t=1755021240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Accessibility and Localization:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully guided tutorials and smart tooltips</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full support for English and Russian languages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy-to-navigate UI designed for both new and experienced puzzle players</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>From the Developer:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HEXA WORLD 3D is a solo-developed.<br>Thank you for supporting the game, leaving feedback, and helping improve the experience. Let\u2019s build something amazing together.</p>",
